#: ../../learn/testing.rst:2
msgid "Test your agent"
msgstr "测试你的智能体"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:4
msgid "Use deterministic models to test runtime behavior and a small set of opt-in live evaluations to test model quality. They answer different questions: \"Did my tool, routing, and cleanup work?\" does not require a network request; \"Does this model reliably solve the task?\" does."
msgstr "用确定性的模型测试运行时行为，再用少量按需启用的在线评估测试模型质量。它们回答的是不同的问题：“我的工具、路由和清理是否正常工作？”不需要网络请求；“这个模型能否可靠地解决任务？”则需要。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:10
msgid "Test tools as Python operations"
msgstr "把工具当作 Python 操作来测试"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:12
msgid "Decoration returns an ``AgentTool``, so call it with an argument mapping. This exercises validation and the handler without asking a model to select it:"
msgstr "装饰器会返回一个 ``AgentTool``，因此可以用参数映射来调用它。这样无需让模型选择它，就能检验校验和处理函数："

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:32
msgid "Install ``pytest`` and ``pytest-asyncio`` in your test environment. Direct tool calls propagate exceptions; inside an agent run, ordinary tool exceptions become unsuccessful results. Test both boundaries for important integrations."
msgstr "在测试环境中安装 ``pytest`` 和 ``pytest-asyncio``\\ 。直接调用工具会向外传播异常；而在智能体运行内部，普通的工具异常会变成失败的工具结果。对重要的集成，请同时测试这两种边界情况。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:37
msgid "Script the model's decisions"
msgstr "用脚本预设模型的决策"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:39
msgid "Implement the public :class:`~zett_agent.model.AgentModel` protocol to choose exactly what the model returns in a test. There is no special mock-agent API: the real runtime still restores history, validates tools, dispatches events, and cleans up."
msgstr "实现公开的 :class:`~zett_agent.model.AgentModel` 协议，就能在测试中精确决定模型返回什么。这里没有专门的 mock 智能体 API：真实的运行时仍会恢复历史记录、校验工具、分发事件并进行清理。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:48
msgid "This adapter first asks for ``add``, then answers using the returned tool result. Its imports, tool, dispatcher, and assertions are in :download:`streaming_tools.py <../_examples/streaming_tools.py>`. Successful adapters must return a terminal ``ModelResponse`` containing the complete message. Text deltas alone do not constitute a final answer. See :doc:`../extending/model-adapter` for stream invariants."
msgstr "这个适配器先请求 ``add``，然后使用返回的工具结果作答。它的导入、工具、分发器和断言都在 :download:`streaming_tools.py <../_examples/streaming_tools.py>` 中。成功的适配器必须返回一个包含完整消息的终止 ``ModelResponse``\\ 。仅有文本增量并不构成最终答案。关于流的约束条件，参见 :doc:`../extending/model-adapter`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:56
msgid "Assert behavior, not incidental timing"
msgstr "断言行为，而非偶然的时序"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:58
msgid "For a tool-calling workflow, verify the request includes the expected tool, the handler receives the right arguments, the model receives its result, and the client returns the expected answer. For concurrent tools, correlate by tool-call ID rather than assuming completion order."
msgstr "对于工具调用工作流，请验证请求中包含预期的工具、处理函数收到正确的参数、模型收到其结果，以及客户端返回预期的答案。对于并发工具，应通过工具调用 ID 进行关联，而不是假设完成顺序。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:63
msgid "Extend the same test to cover:"
msgstr "扩展同一个测试，以覆盖以下情况："

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:65
msgid "Invalid arguments and a handler error the model can recover from."
msgstr "无效参数，以及模型能够从中恢复的处理函数错误。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:66
msgid "Two isolated sessions and restored history after reopening storage."
msgstr "两个相互隔离的会话，以及重新打开存储后恢复的历史记录。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:67
msgid "Early stream closure, request timeout, and request-local cleanup."
msgstr "流的提前关闭、请求超时，以及请求本地的清理。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:68
msgid "A rejected or duplicate approval response, not only approval success."
msgstr "被拒绝或重复的审批响应，而不只是审批成功。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:69
msgid "Budget exhaustion and a provider stream that fails after partial output."
msgstr "预算耗尽，以及提供商流在部分输出之后失败。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:71
msgid "Use events, queues, or explicit test barriers to synchronize concurrency. Avoid timing-dependent sleeps. The examples in :doc:`../examples/index` include assertions for many of these boundaries."
msgstr "使用事件、队列或显式的测试屏障来同步并发。避免依赖时序的 sleep。许多这类边界都在 :doc:`../examples/index` 的示例中包含断言。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:76
msgid "Test a real adapter without a real endpoint"
msgstr "在没有真实端点的情况下测试真实适配器"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:78
msgid "Inject ``httpx.MockTransport`` to test a built-in provider's request encoding and streamed response handling:"
msgstr "注入 ``httpx.MockTransport``，即可测试内置提供商的请求编码和流式响应处理："

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:84
msgid "This program uses the actual OpenAI adapter with a local canned SSE response. It asserts the request path and user message, so no credential or network access is required. Run ``uv run python docs/_examples/provider_mock.py`` from a checkout:"
msgstr "这个程序使用真实的 OpenAI 适配器，搭配本地预设的 SSE 响应。它会断言请求路径和用户消息，因此不需要凭据或网络访问。在检出目录中运行 ``uv run python docs/_examples/provider_mock.py``："

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:93
msgid ":download:`Download provider_mock.py <../_examples/provider_mock.py>`. Other providers expose the same ``transport`` injection point, but their wire formats differ. A passing mock test proves your protocol fixture works, not that a live endpoint supports every requested model feature."
msgstr ":download:`下载 provider_mock.py <../_examples/provider_mock.py>`\\ 。其他提供商暴露相同的 ``transport`` 注入点，但它们的传输格式不同。通过的 mock 测试只能证明你的协议夹具可用，而不能证明线上端点支持所请求的每一项模型特性。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:99
msgid "Keep tests safe and reproducible"
msgstr "让测试安全且可复现"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:101
msgid "Use temporary directories for files and SQLite databases. Never let a test construct a default user-data store or discover personal MCP/skill files. Pass explicit paths, explicit server lists, and explicit skill roots. Keep credentials absent from offline tests and opt into live calls separately."
msgstr "文件和 SQLite 数据库请使用临时目录。绝不要让测试构造默认的用户数据存储，或发现个人的 MCP/技能文件。请传入显式的路径、显式的服务器列表和显式的技能根目录。离线测试中不要出现凭据，并单独选择启用在线调用。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:106
msgid "The downloadable documentation programs are exercised by ``make docs-examples`` with network connections disabled and temporary working directories. ``make check`` additionally checks formatting, the runtime coverage gate, and a warning-free isolated documentation build."
msgstr "可下载的文档程序由 ``make docs-examples`` 在禁用网络连接并使用临时工作目录的情况下运行。\\ ``make check`` 还会额外检查格式、运行时覆盖率门槛，以及一次无警告的隔离文档构建。"

#: ../../learn/testing.rst:111
msgid "Next: :doc:`application` for production boundaries, or :doc:`../examples/cancellation` for a complete cleanup test."
msgstr "下一步：关于生产环境边界，参见 :doc:`application`，关于完整的清理测试，参见 :doc:`../examples/cancellation`\\ 。"

